# Case records

A case is the record. The chat is not.

`case.md` frontmatter is flat. One key per line. Quote the website. Booleans are `true` or `false`.

Required keys: `case_id`, `status`, `vendor_legal_name`, `website`, `touches_customer_data`, `business_owner`, `target_start_date`, `requester`, `sources_mode`, `research_started`, `missing_fields`, `security_required`, `security_decision`, `security_signed_by`, `manager_required`, `manager_decision`, `manager_signed_by`.

`sources_mode` is `mocked` when the pack was built from `fixtures/public-web/`. It is `none` when the requester already gave all five fields and research did not run.

The body starts with the handoff:

```
Status: <status>
Case: <case_id>
See it in Cursor: cases/<case_id>/
```

Then `## What I automated` and `## What still needs a person`. Until a human has signed `approved` or `declined`, the body ends with `I did not approve this vendor.`

`research-pack.md` uses the checklist in `templates/checklist.md`. Evidence paths are repo-relative and must exist. The body includes `Data touch: yes` or `Data touch: no`, a `## Sources` list of https URLs for every found page, and `Gaps: none` or a listed gap.

`audit.md` has `## Automated` and `## Needs a person`. Those headings match the ledger and `/ops/`.

`approval-email.md` links to `https://ac-solarch.vercel.app/approval/<case_id>`. Do not create it while a required field is missing. When all five fields came from the requester, set `research_started: false` and `sources_mode: none`, and do not add a research pack. Globex (`VND-1103`) has no approval email.

When a case changes, update its ledger row in `cases/ledger.md`.
